# i-nudge: Technical Architecture

This document defines the technical architecture, component hierarchy, state management, and technology stack for the **i-nudge** application.

---

## 1. High-Level Technical Architecture

```mermaid
graph TB
    subgraph CLIENT["Client-Side SPA (Web Browser)"]
        direction TB
        HTML["index.html<br/>• Root HTML Document<br/>• Google Material Symbols & Fonts"]
        VITE["Vite 5.1 Build & Dev Server<br/>• Hot Module Replacement (HMR)<br/>• Fast PostCSS & Tailwind Bundling"]
        
        subgraph REACT_LAYER["React 18 Component Tree"]
            direction TB
            MAIN["main.jsx<br/>• React Entry Point<br/>• Global ErrorBoundary"]
            APP["App.jsx<br/>• Central State Hub<br/>• Budget / Debt Calculation Engine<br/>• Navigation & Toast State Manager"]
            
            subgraph LAYOUT["Layout & Shell Layer"]
                SHELL["AppShell.jsx<br/>• Mobile Viewport Shell<br/>• Keyboard Navigation (Keys 1-5, Esc)<br/>• Global Toast / Snackbar Bar"]
                NAV["BottomNav.jsx<br/>• 5-Tab Navigation Bar<br/>• Active Tab Highlights & Emergency Badges"]
                TOUR["TourCard.jsx<br/>• Interactive Onboarding Tour Overlay<br/>• Multi-step Navigation & Skip Flow"]
            end
            
            subgraph PAGES["Page Modules"]
