## 3. State & Persistence Architecture

```mermaid
flowchart LR
    subgraph REACT_STATE["React State (Managed in App.jsx)"]
        direction TB
        S1["onboarded (boolean)"]
        S2["activeTab ('home' | 'coach' | 'simulation' | 'emergency' | 'profile')"]
        S3["dangerMode (boolean)"]
        S4["monthlyIncome + loggedIncome (number)"]
        S5["fixedBills[] (array of bill objects)"]
        S6["loggedSpending[] (array of transactions)"]
        S7["simulatedBnplItems[] (array of active simulation debts)"]
        S8["savingsTarget (percentage number)"]
        S9["liquidCash (reserve number)"]
        S10["toast ({ message, type, canUndo })"]
        S11["tourActive / tourPageIndex / tourElemIndex"]
    end

    subgraph LOCAL_STORAGE["Browser LocalStorage"]
        direction TB
        LS1["nudge_has_seen_tour<br/>Tracks tour completion"]
        LS2["nudge_emergency_acknowledged<br/>Tracks crisis acknowledgement"]
        LS3["nudge_providers<br/>Custom added payment providers"]
    end

    subgraph STATIC_DATA["Static Config (mockData.js)"]
        direction TB
        D1["DEBT_STACK (Default BNPL liabilities)"]
        D2["NAV_ITEMS (Tab definitions & icons)"]
        D3["TOUR_STEPS (4-stage tour configuration)"]
        D4["HARDSHIP_INFO (Provider deferral programs)"]
    end

    S11 <-->|"read / write"| LS1
    S9 <-->|"read / write"| LS2
    LOCAL_STORAGE <-->|"Simulation Provider Manager"| LS3

    D1 -->|"imported into"| REACT_STATE
    D2 -->|"imported into"| REACT_STATE
    D3 -->|"imported into"| REACT_STATE

    style REACT_STATE fill:#ecfdf5,stroke:#059669,stroke-width:2px
    style LOCAL_STORAGE fill:#eff6ff,stroke:#3b82f6,stroke-width:2px
    style STATIC_DATA fill:#fdf4ff,stroke:#a855f7,stroke-width:2px
```

